	(descr "KLJ-5018-5040 5.5x5.5x1.8 mm SMD PASSIVE (externally driven) electromagnetic buzzer, 5 V, 4 kHz, 25 ohm coil (LCSC C18186309). Terminals 1.22x0.66 at x +-2.14, y +-1.58 (Keliking datasheet). The datasheet top and bottom views disagree on mirroring, so BOTH rows are padded: left face = 2x pad 1 (+), right face = 2x pad 2 (-). All 3 terminals land correctly either way; the dummy terminal is on the + face in every view.")
